---
interface Props {
  /** Webflow component instance id (scopes the IX3 card-deck interaction). */
  instanceId: string;
}

const { instanceId } = Astro.props;
---
<section data-wf-component-id="898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3ce" data-wf-variant-state="base" class="section warm">
  <div class="section-gap">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header center">
        <div class="badge">
          <div class="badge-dot"></div>
          <div>Patient stories</div>
        </div>
        <h2 class="section-heading center">Trusted by families at every stage</h2>
      </div>
      <div to-top-2="" class="deck-stage">
        <div data-wf-target={`[[["898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3ce","898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3d9"],["${instanceId}"]]]`} class="deck-card">
          <div class="ts-copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 34 30" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="story-quote-icon">
              <path d="M0 30V17.6C0 12.9 1.1 9 3.3 5.9 5.6 2.8 8.9.8 13.2 0l1.9 3.6c-2.6.7-4.5 2-5.8 3.9-1.3 1.8-1.9 3.9-1.9 6.2h7V30H0Zm18.9 0V17.6c0-4.7 1.1-8.6 3.3-11.7C24.5 2.8 27.8.8 32.1 0L34 3.6c-2.6.7-4.5 2-5.8 3.9-1.3 1.8-1.9 3.9-1.9 6.2h7V30H18.9Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
            </svg>
            <h3 class="profile-section-title narrow">Support when I needed it most as a first-time mom</h3>
            <p class="quote-text muted">“From my first appointment to the day I welcomed my little one, I felt supported every step of the way. The team made me feel safe, heard and confident throughout my pregnancy.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ts-person">
            <div class="ts-photo"><img width="1208" height="1596" alt="Elena Rossi, Fertiva patient" src="/images/Image-Smiling-pregnant-woman-in-light-blue-dress-gently-holding-her-belly-outdoors..webp" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/Image-Smiling-pregnant-woman-in-light-blue-dress-gently-holding-her-belly-outdoors.-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Image-Smiling-pregnant-woman-in-light-blue-dress-gently-holding-her-belly-outdoors.-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Image-Smiling-pregnant-woman-in-light-blue-dress-gently-holding-her-belly-outdoors.-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Image-Smiling-pregnant-woman-in-light-blue-dress-gently-holding-her-belly-outdoors..webp 1208w" sizes="(max-width: 1208px) 100vw, 1208px" class="care-bg-image"></div>
            <p class="srv-title center">Elena Rossi</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-wf-target={`[[["898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3ce","898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3e6"],["${instanceId}"]]]`} class="deck-card deck-two">
          <div class="ts-copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 34 30" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="story-quote-icon">
              <path d="M0 30V17.6C0 12.9 1.1 9 3.3 5.9 5.6 2.8 8.9.8 13.2 0l1.9 3.6c-2.6.7-4.5 2-5.8 3.9-1.3 1.8-1.9 3.9-1.9 6.2h7V30H0Zm18.9 0V17.6c0-4.7 1.1-8.6 3.3-11.7C24.5 2.8 27.8.8 32.1 0L34 3.6c-2.6.7-4.5 2-5.8 3.9-1.3 1.8-1.9 3.9-1.9 6.2h7V30H18.9Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
            </svg>
            <h3 class="profile-section-title narrow">After years of trying, IVF finally felt hopeful</h3>
            <p class="quote-text muted">“My specialist explained every option clearly and adjusted the plan to my body. When our first scan showed a heartbeat, the whole team celebrated with us.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ts-person">
            <div class="ts-photo"><img width="4096" height="2731" alt="Sarah Whitfield, Fertiva patient" src="/images/b37a5531e46aa42cb78c7650b66a96f8e9d26d36.webp" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/b37a5531e46aa42cb78c7650b66a96f8e9d26d36-p-500.webp 500w, /images/b37a5531e46aa42cb78c7650b66a96f8e9d26d36-p-800.webp 800w, /images/b37a5531e46aa42cb78c7650b66a96f8e9d26d36-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/b37a5531e46aa42cb78c7650b66a96f8e9d26d36-p-1600.webp 1600w, /images/b37a5531e46aa42cb78c7650b66a96f8e9d26d36-p-2000.webp 2000w, /images/b37a5531e46aa42cb78c7650b66a96f8e9d26d36-p-2600.webp 2600w, /images/b37a5531e46aa42cb78c7650b66a96f8e9d26d36-p-3200.webp 3200w, /images/b37a5531e46aa42cb78c7650b66a96f8e9d26d36.webp 4096w" sizes="(max-width: 4096px) 100vw, 4096px" class="care-bg-image"></div>
            <p class="srv-title center">Sarah Whitfield</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div data-wf-target={`[[["898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3ce","898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3f3"],["${instanceId}"]]]`} class="deck-card deck-three">
          <div class="ts-copy"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 34 30" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" class="story-quote-icon">
              <path d="M0 30V17.6C0 12.9 1.1 9 3.3 5.9 5.6 2.8 8.9.8 13.2 0l1.9 3.6c-2.6.7-4.5 2-5.8 3.9-1.3 1.8-1.9 3.9-1.9 6.2h7V30H0Zm18.9 0V17.6c0-4.7 1.1-8.6 3.3-11.7C24.5 2.8 27.8.8 32.1 0L34 3.6c-2.6.7-4.5 2-5.8 3.9-1.3 1.8-1.9 3.9-1.9 6.2h7V30H18.9Z" fill="currentColor"></path>
            </svg>
            <h3 class="profile-section-title narrow">Clear answers instead of endless guessing</h3>
            <p class="quote-text muted">“Fertility testing gave us a full picture in just a few days. For the first time we understood what was happening and knew exactly what to do next.”</p>
          </div>
          <div class="ts-person">
            <div class="ts-photo"><img width="1200" height="1148" alt="Priya Nair, Fertiva patient" src="/images/Container-30.webp" loading="lazy" srcset="/images/Container-30-p-500.webp 500w, /images/Container-30-p-800.webp 800w, /images/Container-30-p-1080.webp 1080w, /images/Container-30.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" class="care-bg-image"></div>
            <p class="srv-title center">Priya Nair</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div to-top-2="" class="deck-controls">
        <div class="deck-group">
          <a aria-label="Previous story" data-wf-target={`[[["898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3ce","898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c402"],["${instanceId}"]]]`} href="#" class="doctor-slider-arrow deck left w-button"></a>
          <a aria-label="Previous story" data-wf-target={`[[["898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3ce","898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c403"],["${instanceId}"]]]`} href="#" class="doctor-slider-arrow deck is-hidden-left w-button"></a>
          <a aria-label="Previous story" data-wf-target={`[[["898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3ce","898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c404"],["${instanceId}"]]]`} href="#" class="doctor-slider-arrow deck is-hidden-left w-button"></a>
        </div>
        <div class="deck-group">
          <a aria-label="Next story" data-wf-target={`[[["898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3ce","898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c406"],["${instanceId}"]]]`} href="#" class="doctor-slider-arrow deck w-button"></a>
          <a aria-label="Next story" data-wf-target={`[[["898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3ce","898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c407"],["${instanceId}"]]]`} href="#" class="doctor-slider-arrow deck is-hidden w-button"></a>
          <a aria-label="Next story" data-wf-target={`[[["898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c3ce","898a8b95-11a9-32c2-ff1f-d09116d8c408"],["${instanceId}"]]]`} href="#" class="doctor-slider-arrow deck is-hidden w-button"></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
